    price : total of the unit prices below, kept as a fallback for builds
            that have no unit price at all

  Inside each <build>, <parts> holds one <part> per cell of the left-hand table.
    field : index of the left-hand field (0 Windows, 1 CPU, 2 Motherboard,
            3 Graphics card, 4 RAM, 5 PSU, 6 HDD, 7 SSD, 8 Case,
            9 Optical drive, 10 Cooler, 11 Wi-Fi card, 12 Monitor,
            13 Keyboard/mouse/gamepad, 14 Software)
    price : unit price in HKD; the parts subtotal is the sum of these values,
            so a part without a price (integrated graphics, for example) adds
            nothing to the total
    text  : product name placed into that field

  A field with no <part> entry stays blank. Windows is left blank on every
  build because the FAQ (A02) states that builds do not include Windows.
-->
